msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 2.16.3.Final, our third maintenance release for "
"the 2.16 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As usual, it contains bugfixes and documentation improvements,\n"
"together with some small enhancements such as the ability to define custom "
"credentials for the Flyway connection."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 2.16."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 2.16, please refer to https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.16[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.16.3."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.16.3.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
